<<^ code="&#x0002;">>

! ECM Scan

<<~ ahu #/definition>>

!! Definition

Sensing and analyzing active Powers, activations, and noospheric signatures — the electronic-countermeasure scan of the substrate.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/activation>>

!! Activation

Reveals ''what runs on the noosphere'': strength, type, and owner-trace of active effects in range. A passive read at base P; deeper analysis on overcharge.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/interaction>>

!! Interaction

Feeds `function/magic-decode` and `function/archive`. The `ecm` counter-set — `veil`, `jam`, `spoof`, `negate`, `suppress` — degrades or blinds it. This is the first vocabulary for module-on-module interaction (counterpoint; Sprint 4).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/filters>>

!! Filters

```text
[tag[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/ecm-scan]]              all ecm-scan modules
[tag[prefix[lar:///ha.ka.ba/sdm/components/function/]]]              all function components
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu #/aftermath>>

!! Aftermath

* The full ECM mode-set (`veil` `jam` `spoof` `negate` `suppress` `redirect` `capture` `absorb` `hijack`) wants component memes when counterpoint lands. Promote on first query (Principle 6).

<<~/ahu>>

